; An open with an invalid booking method takes the booking_method option in
; effect on its line: the default above the option, the option's value below.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Before "BOGUS"
option "booking_method" "FIFO"
2020-01-01 open Assets:After "fifo"
2020-01-01 open Equity:Opening

2020-01-02 * "Buy"
  Assets:After  1 HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:After  1 HOOL {20 USD}
  Equity:Opening

2020-01-03 * "Sell, booked FIFO"
  Assets:After  -1 HOOL {}
  Equity:Opening
